flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> R[Register and Login]
    R --> D1[Upload Identity Document]
    D1 --> D2[Run OCR and Validation]
    D2 --> Q1{Document Stage OK?}
    Q1 -- No --> M1[Mark for Manual Review]
    Q1 -- Yes --> F1[Upload Selfie]

    F1 --> F2[Run Face Match]
    F2 --> D3[Run Deepfake Check]
    D3 --> L1[Run Liveness Check]

    L1 --> DEC[Compute Final Score and Decision]
    DEC --> Q2{Auto-Approve Rules Met?}

    Q2 -- Yes --> AP[Approve and Generate PDF]
    Q2 -- No --> FL[Flag for Admin Review]

    FL --> AR[Admin Decision]
    AR --> Q3{Decision}
    Q3 -- Approved --> AP
    Q3 -- Rejected --> RJ[Reject and Notify]
    Q3 -- Reupload --> RU[Request Re-upload]

    AP --> E([End])
    RJ --> E
    RU --> E
    M1 --> E
